%%{init: {'look':'neo', 'theme':'redux-color'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    box "Client & Application"
        participant C as Client
        participant AC as Auth Controller
        participant H as Handler
        participant U as User (Domain)
    end

    box "Persistence (DbContext & DB)"
        participant WR as Repository / DbContext
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end

    box "Background Infrastructure"
        participant OS as Signal (Channel)
        participant OP as Outbox Processor
        participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    end

    box "Email Delivery"
        participant EC as Consumer
        participant SMTP as SMTP Server
    end

    Note over C, SMTP: == STAGE 1: Request Handling ==

    C->>AC: POST /forgot-password { email }
    AC->>H: Send Command
    
    H->>WR: Find User
    WR->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE Email = ?
    DB-->>WR: Return Row
    WR-->>H: Return User Entity
    
    H->>U: RequestPasswordReset()
    Note over U: Creates Domain Event
    
    Note over H, DB: ATOMIC TRANSACTION (Unit of Work)
    H->>WR: SaveChangesAsync()
    
    rect rgba(200, 200, 255, 0.4)
        Note right of WR: Inside DbContext
        WR->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        WR->>DB: UPDATE Users
        WR->>DB: INSERT INTO OutboxMessages
        WR->>DB: COMMIT
    end
    
    WR-)OS: TryWrite(true) (Wake up signal)
    
    WR-->>H: Success
    H-->>C: 200 OK
    
    Note over C, SMTP: == STAGE 2: Outbox Processing ==

    OS-)OP: Signal Received
    OP->>DB: SELECT * FROM OutboxMessages
    DB-->>OP: [PasswordResetEvent]
    
    OP->>RMQ: Publish Event
    RMQ-->>OP: ACK
    
    OP->>DB: UPDATE OutboxMessages (Mark Processed)
    
    Note over C, SMTP: == STAGE 3: Delivery ==
    
    RMQ->>EC: Consume Message
    EC->>SMTP: Send Email
    SMTP->>C: Email Received
    EC->>RMQ: ACK Message